","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-06-13T21:35:14Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T08:41:04Z","closed_at":"2026-06-22T08:40:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.7.dev4.official [755fa449c]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev4 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon 780M Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21030.2001) - AMD Ryzen 7 8745HS w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads) - 31.32 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen adding an _autoload_ to the project from an already existing script located in a subfolder of the project (main folder), path is not filled and so _Godot_ is unable to found the script and rise an error.\n\n<img width=\"1173\" height=\"329\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c7b00be-0dcf-4841-adfe-6682a9d97718\" />\n\n<img width=\"1114\" height=\"262\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/caa8218b-28af-4bbd-beec-3a1c4e182db5\" />\n\nIn these pics, Global2 has been created from the _autoload_ tab of _project settings_.\n<img width=\"1181\" height=\"213\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a35aeeec-6417-4ed5-bf56-60175e6c646d\" />\n\n<img width=\"733\" height=\"712\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e1446dd-40ca-4d4f-96e3-984ebea6489f\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- create a folder inside _res://_ main project folder (names doesn't matter),\n- add a script in there with at leat one variable\n- in _project settings_, add an _autoload_ using '_Select script/scene_' button,\n- the script is added with an empty folder in _Path_ column\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[global-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28919099/global-issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120273/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120273/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}